    "content": {
      "id": "6abd32006b722c561dc6a8fc",
      "meta": {
        "version": "0.0.3"
      },
      "zone": "ncs",
      "boardRef": "6a2629f436bfe25a75cb4c82",
      "content": "<div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f2cb237a-ec897227-72c0-4aa8-90d0-3584a8b8fc19&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f2cb237a-ec897227-72c0-4aa8-90d0-3584a8b8fc19\" alt=\"announcements_EN.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Hello Daevas, We'll be performing maintenance to address a bottleneck issue that occurred when interacting with objects in certain quests.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">During the maintenance, the game login will be temporarily unavailable. We'll share an update via this notice if the timeline changes.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><h2 id=\"\"><u><strong>Details:</strong></u></h2><div class=\"tableWrapper\"><table class=\"\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 89px;\"><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"89\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">When:</div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">September 30, 2026 at 23:00 PDT / October 1 08:00 CEST</div></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"89\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Duration:​</div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">​1.5 hours</div></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"89\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Affected Services:</div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\